### Local configuration / secrets ###
# Never commit real credentials or local-only configuration
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.log
# Local (machine-specific) Spring configuration, e.g. application-local.properties
**/application-local.properties
**/application-local.yml

### LOCAL ONLY configuration with REAL credentials (NEVER push) ###
# Two-file strategy: application.properties stays local-only,
# application-example.properties is the GitHub-safe template.
src/main/resources/application.properties
